Lossless source alpha: original-code license has not yet been selected.
The development repository is private; this is not an open-source release.

Retained research code provenance is recorded in
src/lossless/resources/PROVENANCE.json. Paths there identify the local research
archive used for extraction, not runtime dependencies.

MLX-LM-derived grouped-head execution retains its MIT notice in
src/lossless/adapters/mlx/MLX_LM_LICENSE.

The bundled mathematical statement index and pinned mathlib project retain
the mathlib Apache 2.0 license in
src/lossless/resources/theorems/MATHLIB_LICENSE.
The extraction receipt, mathlib revision and Lake manifest accompany the index.

NumPy, optional SciPy, MLX, MLX-LM, and externally installed Lean/Elan/mathlib
retain their own licenses. Model weights are not bundled and remain subject
to the model publisher's terms.
